October 10, 2026:
-Ported from GLFW 2 to GLFW 3 (GLFW 2 is no longer shipped by distributions)
-Updated for current GLM (0.9.9 / 1.x): radians everywhere, identity
 default constructors, GLM_ENABLE_EXPERIMENTAL
-Shaders now target OpenGL 3.3 core (#version 330, texture() instead of
 texture2D()) so they compile on Mesa; dropped ARB uniform entry points
-Fixed buffer over-reads in VMD/PMX text decoding, texture index -1 crash,
 shared toon texture off-by-one, missing-texture crash
-Case-insensitive texture lookup for models made on Windows
-Resizable window, aspect ratio follows the framebuffer
-Build system: pkg-config for dependencies, headers installed under
 include/libmmp, generated autotools files removed (run ./autogen.sh)
-Added Debian packaging

January 12, 2014:
-removed model data file from git repo history
-Updated README with info on libglm,libglew,
-Fixed bug that caused SDL2/SDL2_mixer to be required even with enable-sound turned off (or SDL2/SDL2_mixer unavailable)

January 11, 2014: ver 0.1 release
